              "type": "basic.info",
              "data": {
                "info": "### Truth table for XOR\n\n| k | input | output | function |\n|---|-------|--------|----------|\n| 0 | 0     |  0     | wire     |\n| 0 | 1     |  1     | wire     |\n| 1 | 0     |  1     | Not      |\n| 1 | 1     |  0     | Not      |",
                "readonly": true
              },
              "position": {
